  "description": {
   "en": "Aim to become the “hero” of your life!\n\nSadayoshi Tanabe and Michiyuki Nakayama, a clumsy car salesman, have never got along ever since childhood. But their destiny changes drastically when they become heroes after fighting off a robbery. Although they were sincere and truthful, they are fired from their jobs and somehow end up working together to build a new company.\n\nWill the two be able to achieve “true success”?"
  },
